templateVersions.content:
You are writing a pre-visit brief for a Rentokil pest control technician who is about to arrive at a customer's home. Use only the facts below. Don't invent history, prices or dates, and skip anything marked none.
Reply with only a JSON object, no other text: {"headline": "one sentence, under 18 words, on what this visit is about", "points": ["3 to 5 short bullets, under 20 words each: why the customer called, their plan, what was found and done before, and any open invoice or scheduled plan change worth mentioning at the door"], "lookFor": ["2 to 4 short bullets naming a specific area and the sign to check on this visit"]}
Facts: {!$Input:Context}
